Subject: [PATCH] FeedbackDiffusion: compile-time opt-out for the capped core

Keep line/reference sizing and all existing engine fixes while disabling only feedback
diffusion in the 1330-capped AAR. Native builds retain the existing implementation.
Core CMake supplies PROJECTMTV_DISABLE_FEEDBACK_DIFFUSION for the capped policy.

---
diff --git a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/FeedbackDiffusion.cpp b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/FeedbackDiffusion.cpp
--- a/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/FeedbackDiffusion.cpp
+++ b/src/libprojectM/MilkdropPreset/FeedbackDiffusion.cpp
@@ -201,6 +201,10 @@
 
 FeedbackDiffusion::FeedbackDiffusion()
 {
+#ifdef PROJECTMTV_DISABLE_FEEDBACK_DIFFUSION
+    // The capped core preserves its pre-compensation feedback and skips the optional shader.
+    return;
+#endif
     std::string vertexShader(static_cast<const char*>(ShaderVersion));
     std::string fragmentShader(static_cast<const char*>(ShaderVersion));
     vertexShader.append(static_cast<const char*>(VertexShader));
